1
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:20,962
You're awake?

2
00:00:23,888 --> 00:00:25,450
What are you doing in my house?

3
00:00:26,194 --> 00:00:28,100
What did you say?

4
00:00:28,475 --> 00:00:29,825
Why are you in my house?

5
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:32,450
Are you still half asleep?

6
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:33,050
I'm your wife.

7
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,575
Where else would I be?

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,500
Stop joking.

9
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,350
Work needs me.

10
00:00:36,425 --> 00:00:37,325
I've got to go.

11
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:44,375
If you change the past,

12
00:00:45,775 --> 00:00:47,200
the future changes with it.

13
00:01:03,125 --> 00:01:03,950
You're awake?

14
00:01:05,525 --> 00:01:06,750
I'm off to the station.

15
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:08,686
Fix yourself something to eat later.

16
00:02:40,625 --> 00:02:41,600
Xiaodie...

17
00:02:41,600 --> 00:02:42,801
I won't let you die.

18
00:02:48,423 --> 00:02:49,300
Honey!

19
00:02:49,575 --> 00:02:50,325
You're here.

20
00:02:50,575 --> 00:02:51,975
I'm starving.

21
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:53,325
Shall we go for barbecue?

22
00:02:53,650 --> 00:02:55,332
That place over there is really good.

23
00:02:55,975 --> 00:02:56,725
How about it?

24
00:03:08,025 --> 00:03:08,775
Honey.

25
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,375
Is something bothering you today?

26
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Actually,

27
00:03:15,067 --> 00:03:16,625
I have a secret too.

28
00:03:16,775 --> 00:03:18,775
I'll tell you when I'm ready.

29
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:31,225
Actually, I came today

30
00:03:32,522 --> 00:03:34,125
to break up with you.

31
00:03:36,675 --> 00:03:37,775
What did you say?

32
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:40,200
I've been meaning to tell you.

33
00:03:40,325 --> 00:03:41,150
It's over.

34
00:03:41,175 --> 00:03:42,325
Why?

35
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,750
Give me more time.

36
00:03:44,825 --> 00:03:46,500
Then I can tell you everything.

37
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:48,500
It's nothing you've done.

38
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:50,025
It's me.

39
00:03:50,475 --> 00:03:52,250
So you've been lying to me all along?

40
00:03:53,175 --> 00:03:55,050
Something doesn't feel right.

41
00:04:04,875 --> 00:04:07,025
The accidents involving Jianhe and
Xiaodie...

42
00:04:07,050 --> 00:04:08,175
It was the same car.

43
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,150
Xiaodie!

44
00:04:15,375 --> 00:04:16,125
Xiaodie!

45
00:04:32,175 --> 00:04:33,050
Xu...

46
00:04:33,150 --> 00:04:33,900
I...

47
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:36,250
Maybe this is fate.

48
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:44,075
You have one more chance.

49
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:47,150
Stay with Lin Jianhe.

50
00:04:47,350 --> 00:04:48,850
Let Zhao Yidie go.

51
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:52,600
I know

52
00:04:53,075 --> 00:04:54,400
you'll go back one more time.

53
00:04:55,375 --> 00:04:56,900
But for some reason,

54
00:04:57,550 --> 00:04:58,825
this time the machine

55
00:04:58,875 --> 00:04:59,800
wouldn't start.

56
00:05:07,512 --> 00:05:08,412
It's working for now,

57
00:05:08,412 --> 00:05:09,987
but I don't think

58
00:05:09,987 --> 00:05:11,032
it has many trips left.

59
00:05:11,275 --> 00:05:12,400
I think

60
00:05:12,400 --> 00:05:14,100
this may be our last chance.

61
00:05:15,625 --> 00:05:16,525
I want this to end.

62
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:18,600
Good luck.

63
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,900
Chapter 4: Endings
